# Claude Code local scratch — isolated agent worktrees get created here and are never
# meant to be committed; one previously got accidentally committed as a broken gitlink
# (mode 160000, .git pointing at a since-deleted absolute path) and broke every git
# command in this repo until it was untracked. Never let that happen again.
.claude/worktrees/

